  hintId: tutorial_materials
  isUnlockedByDefault: 0
  ignoreLock: 1
  title: Materials
  image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9d3d0ebb76faa10459ff731032deed57, type: 3}
  description: '<b>Materials</b>


    There are two types of materials that can
    be collected during exploration: Gears and Screws.


    To collect a material,
    move in front of it and use the collect() command.


    Some materials are more
    valuable than others depending on their condition. You can check the material
    value by using measure() before collecting it.


    If a material is not useful
    or has low value, you can safely ignore it and continue exploring.'
  isImageBig: 0
